<h1>Little Inkers for <%= kind === 'ios' ? 'iPhone' : 'Android' %></h1>
<p class="muted">The free coloring app for kids — 30+ pages, new packs every Monday. 100% free.</p>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Free download</h2>
  <p><a class="btn" href="/little-inkers-<%= kind %>/download">Download for <%= kind === 'ios' ? 'iPhone' : 'Android' %> (free)</a></p>

  <% if (kind === 'ios') { %>
  <h3>How to install on iPhone</h3>
  <ol>
    <li>Tap the download button above to get the app file.</li>
    <li>Install the free <a href="https://sidestore.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SideStore</a> app on the iPhone.</li>
    <li>Open the downloaded file in SideStore — it installs Little Inkers with your Apple ID.</li>
  </ol>
  <p class="muted fineprint">Grown-ups: sideloaded apps refresh every 7 days through SideStore. This keeps the app free while we finish the App Store version.</p>
  <% } else { %>
  <h3>How to install on Android</h3>
  <ol>
    <li>Tap the download button above to get the app file.</li>
    <li>Open the downloaded file — your phone may ask permission to install apps from this source. Allow it.</li>
    <li>Tap Install. That's it!</li>
  </ol>
  <p class="muted fineprint">Grown-ups: this installs directly and stays free while we finish the Play Store version.</p>
  <% } %>
</div>

<div class="card" style="margin-top:1rem;">
  <h2>Parents, quick notes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>No accounts for kids. No chat, no uploads from the app.</li>
    <li>Ads are kid-safe and never track your child.</li>
    <li>New free coloring packs land every Monday.</li>
  </ul>
</div>
